  "summary": "A movement reviving medieval Gothic architectural elements in the 18th and 19th centuries.",
  "description": "Characterized by pointed arches, ribbed vaults, and flying buttresses, it sought to evoke the spiritual and moral values of the medieval period. This style emerged as a reaction against the industrial revolution and classical formalism, emphasizing craftsmanship and verticality.",
